#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->use-custom-format->tooltip
msgid ""
"Check this to define a custom format for the date in the calendar applet."
msgstr "勾選此選項即可自訂行事曆小工具的日期格式。"

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->custom-format->description
